# DXIL containers emitted by make-evidence.py so that dxv.exe can be handed
# something to validate. They are derived: `python make-evidence.py` recreates
# them, and the readable result -- what dxv said about each -- is committed in
# manual-case-dxv.txt. The script creates this directory itself, so nothing
# depends on git storing an empty one.
dxv-out/
